            "title": "Strings ",
            "id": 126552,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le string sono caratteri racchiusi tra virgolette <code>\" \"</code>, come il valore <code>\"Cookies\"</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dessert = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(dessert)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Cookies\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Numbers ",
            "id": 126553,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Int</strong> è un altro tipo che abbiamo già usato. Rappresenta valori numerici come <code>42</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"42\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>42</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Booleans ",
            "id": 126554,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il tipo <strong>boolean</strong> contiene solo due valori: i valori speciali <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isOn = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(isOn)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
