            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando memorizzi <code>false</code> in <code>isOn</code>, diciamo che <strong>assegni</strong> un valore a una variabile.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isOn = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(isOn)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"49\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>isOn</code>, seguito da <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
