          {
            "title": "Adding and joining",
            "id": 126566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> è il segno di concatenazione o di addizione. Quando concateniamo due variabili, possiamo ottenere risultati diversi a seconda dei loro tipi.</p><p>Unisci i valori e osserva la differenza tra l'uso di <code>+</code> con le stringhe e con i numeri.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1010\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"20\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Strings and numbers 1",
            "id": 126567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando unisci numeri e stringhe in Swift, puoi trasformare il numero in una stringa usando l'interpolazione di stringhe.</p><p>Unisci i valori e osserva la stringa risultante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;10\\(10)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1010\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Strings and numbers 2",
            "id": 126568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combina una stringa e un numero per visualizzare il punteggio di un giocatore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Your score: \\(99)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your score: 99\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\\</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>99</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Strings and number variables",
            "id": 126569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In questo modo funziona anche aggiungere un numero a una stringa quando usiamo una variabile come <code>score</code> che contiene un numero, invece di un valore numerico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Your score: \\(score)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your score: 99\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Strings and booleans 1",
            "id": 126570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche concatenare stringhe e valori booleani.</p><p>Combina una stringa e un booleano per visualizzare il risultato di uno studente. Ha superato l'esame?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed: \\(true)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You passed: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Strings and booleans 2",
            "id": 126571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche aggiungere un booleano a una stringa funziona quando usiamo una variabile come <code>pass</code> che memorizza un booleano.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pass = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed: \\(pass)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;pass&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You passed: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pass</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
